<%= render "manyfold_cults3d/navigation" %>
<h1>Import your Cults3D library</h1>
<p>Refresh your purchased and downloaded free models directly from Cults3D. This updates the saved list and keeps existing links to Manyfold models.</p>
<p>Creating or linking a model syncs its details and images. Download its 3D files from Cults3D and import them into Manyfold separately.</p>
<% unless @configured %>
  <div class="alert alert-info" role="status">Set your Cults3D username and API key under Settings &gt; Integrations. Create a key on <%= link_to "Cults3D", "https://cults3d.com/en/api/keys", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener" %>.</div>
<% end %>
<%= form_with url: manyfold_cults3d.import_path, method: :post do |form| %>
  <%= form.submit "Refresh library", class: "btn btn-primary", disabled: !@configured %>
<% end %>
